# Aganox Standards repo

- Docs are the source of truth; update `APP_CATALOG.md` when repos are added, archived, or renamed.
- Templates under `templates/` must stay generic; no app-specific secrets.
- Keep `.mdc` rules short; prefer linking to `docs/AI_DRIVEN_DEVELOPMENT.md`.